From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000025
Subject: [PATCH] Companion trades: snapshot the companion's inventory before items move

population_engine_companion_equip_traded runs after the trade and equipped
every unworn item in the companion's bag, its own spare arrows and pushed-off
gear included, then handed them to the owner as player gear. It now compares
against this snapshot and acts only on what the trade brought in.

--- a/src/map/trade.cpp
+++ b/src/map/trade.cpp
@@ -665,6 +665,13 @@
